,"explanation":"A maioria das chitas selvagens vive na \u00c1frica Subsaariana, com uma pequena popula\u00e7\u00e3o remanescente no Ir\u00e3.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7144-8183-10da94e6e3c3","description":"\u00c1frica","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-745f-bba8-9022045b7657","description":"Austr\u00e1lia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-76bb-9712-070a20dfc91f","description":"Europa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-736a-8676-8fde9ba960db","description":"Am\u00e9rica do Sul","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-759a-a3b5-0a4e2febe075","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quais s\u00e3o os primeiros d\u00edgitos de pi?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"3,14 \u00e9 uma aproxima\u00e7\u00e3o comum de pi, cujos d\u00edgitos decimais se estendem infinitamente sem se repetirem.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-760e-9579-a273f67b5bdf","description":"3,14","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7531-a8c5-011173b4ea13","description":"3,41","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7885-a0ba-1de7f76dce97","description":"4,31","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7c95-aaba-f06d7fcc1544","description":"1,34","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-76d1-927c-1f3395c16ac2","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 usado como desinfetante em piscinas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cloro ajuda a eliminar micr\u00f3bios nocivos da \u00e1gua da piscina. O cheiro forte e caracter\u00edstico das piscinas geralmente vem das cloraminas, formadas quando o cloro reage com contaminantes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-78d2-8300-84d0d30695fa","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-78ba-b2fe-fbb2c6c32d24","description":"Enxofre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7627-a113-42d1f3be0fda","description":"Carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7391-82c9-aaf70fb9d0b4","description":"Cobalto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7bfe-80d8-09d48ff27d03","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os submarinos utilizam para observar a superf\u00edcie a partir de uma posi\u00e7\u00e3o oculta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um perisc\u00f3pio redireciona a luz, permitindo que algu\u00e9m veja por cima de um obst\u00e1culo enquanto permanece oculto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-787a-8953-d23e3c9afc23","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7a1d-b31e-11cd5ae90a75","description":"Episc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-73d5-b473-bc24c607763a","description":"Estrobosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7386-855f-2746ebb8a2f7","description":"Estetosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7a7d-a274-df5ac358186b","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os herb\u00edvoros comem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os herb\u00edvoros comem plantas, e muitos t\u00eam dentes ou sistemas digestivos adaptados para pastar ou se alimentar de folhagem.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-72f2-ba1d-b482bd1db990","description":"Plantas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-785d-8765-ffb69f5af42c","description":"Besouros","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7860-b827-ee69b31b8dca","description":"Carac\u00f3is","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7c18-a8c3-36df1101184b","description":"Peixes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7eac-8e2d-8fc2c1c411d3","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O cr\u00e2nio, que envolve o c\u00e9rebro, faz parte de qual estrutura \u00f3ssea maior?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cr\u00e2nio inclui tanto o cr\u00e2nio, que protege o c\u00e9rebro, quanto os ossos faciais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7c08-b816-6d54589dd15b","description":"Cr\u00e2nio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-77e3-8e1c-ae120c396225","description":"P\u00e9lvis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7fe8-9d9b-6af8120046bc","description":"Coluna vertebral","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7d0e-8836-73d1dbf29b04","description":"Caixa tor\u00e1cica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ca9-838a-3db83da5c2d5","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem desenvolveu a teoria da evolu\u00e7\u00e3o por sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Charles Darwin exp\u00f4s a sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural em *A Origem das Esp\u00e9cies* (1859), obra desenvolvida ap\u00f3s sua viagem a bordo do HMS Beagle.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ec7-8f17-acef1c5ed0f3","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-71a0-9dc5-8149e3accede","description":"Albert Einstein","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7b23-880d-35d7eedfa2e5","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-72b7-b5ef-35ff4ed03691","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ac2-a668-ad158e0c4b08","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual termo se refere a objetos ou retas que est\u00e3o lado a lado e nunca se cruzam?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As retas paralelas mant\u00eam a mesma dist\u00e2ncia entre si; as retas perpendiculares se encontram em um \u00e2ngulo reto, enquanto as retas convergentes se aproximam uma da outra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-71ec-a20f-17f4a6d71e6b","description":"Paralelas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7fa8-b1c9-bb273a5c400c","description":"Perpendiculares","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7a56-8a7a-97c6065db3b0","description":"Diagonal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7f67-9d45-1edb6688fae8","description":"Convergente","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7a7f-8e84-12480606382f","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"As iguanas marinhas, os crocodilos de \u00e1gua salgada, as cobras marinhas e as tartarugas marinhas pertencem a qual classe de animais?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os r\u00e9pteis s\u00e3o vertebrados que respiram ar e possuem escamas. As tartarugas-marinhas precisam subir \u00e0 superf\u00edcie para respirar, enquanto as iguanas marinhas conseguem prender a respira\u00e7\u00e3o debaixo d\u2019\u00e1gua.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7653-a164-69e6b3fa74fd","description":"R\u00e9pteis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7c0f-9d98-ba5d11737ff2","description":"Mam\u00edferos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-79ec-b8de-75d4eeb6fedb","description":"Anf\u00edbios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ef0-9290-2fbb65314cae","description":"Peixes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-75ee-96b1-aed933b2f303","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de coruja?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um \u201cowlet\u201d \u00e9 um filhote de coruja; a termina\u00e7\u00e3o -let geralmente indica algo pequeno ou jovem, como em \u201cpiglet\u201d (leit\u00e3o).","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-561f-78e0-8fdf-c3737f688d33","description":"Um filhote de coruja","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ae0-8da0-61321875b0e1","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7ae7-bd14-799e90bea66f","description":"Um codling","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7fa1-808d-897d61d1cdfe","description":"Um potro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-561f-7f26-8729-1df08140fd1a","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma borboleta jovem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lagarta \u00e9 o est\u00e1gio larval da borboleta; depois de crescer, ela forma uma cris\u00e1lida e, mais tarde, emerge como