r":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-77ed-86b0-fa30766c5a43","description":"~365 dias","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7f7e-99d6-e32c45d3b126","description":"~1 hora","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-72d8-87ad-b31b6e46216d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a biologia estuda?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O nome \u201cbiologia\u201d tem origem no grego e significa \u201cvida\u201d e \u201cestudo\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7927-b86c-4e656b6df138","description":"Vida","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7208-a265-365ecbab27ff","description":"Toque de sino","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-70cb-8a14-a20a6ddb6c8a","description":"Doen\u00e7as reum\u00e1ticas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-72f0-8e10-607ec8b92928","description":"S\u00edfilis","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-72d0-98a3-cb58daf95429","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual cientista teria se inspirado na queda de uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 para desenvolver sua teoria da gravidade?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lei da gravita\u00e7\u00e3o universal de Isaac Newton descreve a mesma for\u00e7a que atrai uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Terra e mant\u00e9m os planetas em \u00f3rbita.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7527-b8a0-c1621658bb6b","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7512-8bd9-b89fed4cb29b","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7e71-b3c8-95504cce4b37","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-701e-a727-baed4486d5ea","description":"Ernest Rutherford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-70fe-82ac-d18d16419a79","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar uma raposa f\u00eamea?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma raposa f\u00eame