a","description":"Niels Bohr","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-72eb-af7a-6c9a1b9c37c6","description":"Sigmund Freud","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7298-98fb-88dcdc54570c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos quilates tem o ouro puro?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O ouro de 24 quilates \u00e9 considerado puro; classifica\u00e7\u00f5es inferiores indicam que outros metais comp\u00f5em parte da liga.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7a86-bd5e-1a1dd98ed3bd","description":"24 quilates","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-734c-a3d8-d39fc1cd1230","description":"22 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7b41-8d05-f5c88be8a79e","description":"30 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7228-bbf0-dba02588b55d","description":"12 quilates","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-77b3-a64f-473a7f41fc80","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve principalmente o radar?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Radar \u00e9 a sigla para \u201cdetec\u00e7\u00e3o e localiza\u00e7\u00e3o por r\u00e1dio\u201d; o tempo que as ondas de r\u00e1dio refletidas levam para retornar pode revelar a que dist\u00e2ncia algo se encontra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5621-72ee-b36c-460f7aa3f477","description":"Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de objetos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-776f-b4fd-865516f186f3","description":"Amplifica\u00e7\u00e3o de som","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7466-a932-38dc6dea0a71","description":"Gera\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7ee8-8cbd-5ddebcd6b4c7","description":"Medindo a temperatura","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5621-7433-bea8-24b711eee737","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que instrumento podemos usar para observar as estrelas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um telesc\u00f3pio cap